1
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪See the price paid in blood♪</font></font>

2
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Binding half a lifetime of fate♪</font></font>

3
00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Watch her tear apart with her own hands♪</font></font>

4
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:34,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The cold haze of a humble life♪</font></font>

5
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:36,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Trading it for robes of splendor♪</font></font>

6
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Every step is on a blade♪</font></font>

7
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪To the eyes of the world♪</font></font>

8
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She's a bird, a flower, a plaything♪</font></font>

9
00:00:43,420 --> 00:00:46,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But with one sweep she scatters the clouds♪</font></font>

10
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Till bones and all fade into smoke♪</font></font>

11
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:55,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪A game within a game, a fate beyond fate♪</font></font>

12
00:00:55,540 --> 00:01:01,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Who makes the move? Who listens?♪</font></font>

13
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:04,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Behind this mask♪</font></font>

14
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She plays out every soul♪</font></font>

15
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:09,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Each encounter and each step fraught with danger♪</font></font>

16
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Set a wild fire ablaze♪</font></font>

17
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:12,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Burn away these chains♪</font></font>

18
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:15,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let this frost flower fulfill its fate♪</font></font>

19
00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Take a single chess piece♪</font></font>

20
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:18,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And wager heaven and earth♪</font></font>

21
00:01:18,220 --> 00:01:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Pierce through hypocrisy's false mask♪</font></font>

22
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:24,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Stir up a mighty storm♪</font></font>

23
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:30,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Watch her break free and stun the world♪</font></font>

24
00:01:33,140 --> 00:01:35,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Adapted from the novel Where the Mask Ends on Jinjiang Literature City]</font></font>

25
00:01:35,140 --> 00:01:36,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Original Author: Xiao Jiaren]</font></font>

26
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:37,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Where the Mask Ends]</font></font>

27
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:40,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 29]</font></font>

28
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:05,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get lost!</font></font>

29
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The world can change in an instant.</font></font>

30
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once, we fought to the death.</font></font>

31
00:02:15,760 --> 00:02:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Going forward, we might share the same goal.</font></font>

32
00:02:17,880 --> 00:02:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even bitter enemies</font></font>

33
00:02:19,470 --> 00:02:20,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can become allies.</font></font>

34
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:27,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since when does a snake have good intentions?</font></font>

35
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Qi, you care nothing for wealth</font></font>

36
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or power.</font></font>

37
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:34,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The only thing you desire</font></font>

38
00:02:34,470 --> 00:02:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is a certain woman.</font></font>

39
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know she's your friend's wife,</font></font>

40
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:40,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet you can't stay away from her.</font></font>

41
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why? You simply can't help yourself.</font></font>

42
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know exactly what I mean.</font></font>

43
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who do you think you are?</font></font>

44
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You think you can read my mind?</font></font>

45
00:02:53,870 --> 00:02:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because I was on the city wall that day, too.</font></font>

46
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Such breathtaking beauty...</font></font>

47
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hengcheng Gate]</font></font>

48
00:03:01,190 --> 00:03:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Brighter than gold or jewels.</font></font>

49
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:04,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">More tempting than power itself.</font></font>

50
00:03:05,150 --> 00:03:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Enough to make a man's very soul tremble.</font></font>

51
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Zhongkai.</font></font>

52
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:12,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No one in this world understands you better than I do.</font></font>

53
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:21,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everything in this world</font></font>

54
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">has its price.</font></font>

55
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If a deal falls through,</font></font>

56
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the offer simply wasn't high enough.</font></font>

57
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, General Qi?</font></font>

58
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wonder if Noble Lady Wu'an</font></font>

59
00:03:37,910 --> 00:03:39,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is tempting enough for you.</font></font>

60
00:04:09,860 --> 00:04:13,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhaoyang Palace]</font></font>

61
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:18,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty, those elixirs are poisoning you.</font></font>

62
00:04:21,430 --> 00:04:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're worrying over nothing.</font></font>

63
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Brother!</font></font>

64
00:04:26,430 --> 00:04:27,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't stop me!</font></font>

65
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Brother!</font></font>

66
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I need to see Father!</font></font>

67
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The evidence hasn't been verified yet.</font></font>

68
00:04:30,040 --> 00:04:31,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't make a public accusation</font></font>

69
00:04:31,070 --> 00:04:32,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and tarnish the Crown Prince's reputation.</font></font>

70
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father!</font></font>

71
00:04:33,830 --> 00:04:35,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's with all this pushing and pulling?</font></font>

72
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:36,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you no sense of decorum?</font></font>

73
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty's health is at stake.</font></font>

74
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was beside myself with worry.</font></font>

75
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:44,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forgive my disrespect, Father.</font></font>

76
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:45,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father.</font></font>

77
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A palace maid from Furong Hall has reported</font></font>

78
00:04:49,160 --> 00:04:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that Lady Zheng replaced Solomon's seal</font></font>

79
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with poisonous gelsemium in the ginseng soup.</font></font>

80
00:04:56,870 --> 00:04:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's gelsemium?</font></font>

81
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:58,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Gelsemium</font></font>

82
00:05:00,270 --> 00:05:02,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is also called poison root. It resembles Solomon's seal.</font></font>

83
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But Solomon's seal nourishes, while gelsemium is poisonous.</font></font>

84
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's especially deadly with cinnabar.</font></font>

85
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father has been taking elixirs for years.</font></font>

86
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The ginseng soup makes the poison stronger.</font></font>

87
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Within days,</font></font>

88
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'll bleed from every orifice.</font></font>

89
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And no medicine can save you!</font></font>

90
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:22,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty, this ginseng soup</font></font>

91
00:05:22,270 --> 00:05:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">strengthens the body and restores vitality.</font></font>

92
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:27,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You really should drink more of it.</font></font>

93
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The medicinal smell is too strong.</font></font>

94
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I simply can't get used to it.</font></font>

95
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father!</font></font>

96
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I truly knew nothing about this!</font></font>

97
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please believe me, Father!</font></font>

98
00:05:59,310 --> 00:06:00,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

99
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:02,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">These accusations are lies!</font></font>

100
00:06:03,430 --> 00:06:05,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prince Fu resents my son becoming Crown Prince.</font></font>

101
00:06:05,630 --> 00:06:09,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's been plotting to frame him!</font></font>

102
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Which wretched maid in my palace accused me?</font></font>

103
00:06:12,270 --> 00:06:14,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does she dare confront me face-to-face?</font></font>

104
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

105
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:26,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty is rewarding you with</font></font>

106
00:06:26,810 --> 00:06:28,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ginseng and Solomon's seal soup, and a golden elixir.</font></font>

107
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:11,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty, don't make things hard for Shou.</font></font>

108
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's always been your favorite son.</font></font>

109
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He may have his faults,</font></font>

110
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but they're merely romantic indiscretions.</font></font>

111
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'd never risk his life over them.</font></font>

112
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is all my fault.</font></font>

113
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:33,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I couldn't stand</font></font>

114
00:07:34,190 --> 00:07:36,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">watching that woman Zhou Fu grow so arrogant!</font></font>

115
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She's nothing but a lowly wet nurse's daughter,</font></font>

116
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:43,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">yet she dared claim equal standing with me, the daughter of a Grand Commandant!</font></font>

117
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:47,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was humiliated in public before,</font></font>

118
00:07:47,870 --> 00:07:50,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and Your Majesty believed only her side.</font></font>

119
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You mistreated me</font></font>

120
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:56,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and humiliated me like this!</font></font>

121
00:07:56,950 --> 00:08:00,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I possibly bear it, Your Majesty?</font></font>

122
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:20,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty.</font></font>

123
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What has Shou done to deserve this?</font></font>

124
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:26,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prince Fu is trying to frame the Crown Prince.</font></font>

125
00:08:26,950 --> 00:08:30,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wants to take his place, Your Majesty!</font></font>

126
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:34,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you really going to have another son killed?</font></font>

127
00:08:34,670 --> 00:08:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

128
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father, I'm innocent!</font></font>

129
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:42,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've been falsely accused! I'm innocent!</font></font>

130
00:08:43,030 --> 00:08:43,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father!</font></font>

131
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:48,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- What has Shou done wrong?
- I'm innocent!</font></font>

132
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:53,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- What has Shou done wrong? - Guards!</font></font>

133
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

134
00:08:58,150 --> 00:08:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

135
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty!</font></font>

136
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What has Shou done to deserve this?</font></font>

137
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What has Shou done wrong?</font></font>

138
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:15,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go back.</font></font>

139
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You should be grateful to your mother.</font></font>

140
00:09:21,510 --> 00:09:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She may be foolish and shortsighted,</font></font>

141
00:09:25,270 --> 00:09:26,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but when your life was on the line,</font></font>

142
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">she was willing to die for you.</font></font>

143
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:32,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She was right.</font></font>

144
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:34,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I...</font></font>

145
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:37,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want to lose another son.</font></font>

146
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">From now on, know your place</font></font>

147
00:09:43,550 --> 00:09:44,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and be grateful for what you have.</font></font>

148
00:09:59,180 --> 00:10:01,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Crown Prince's Residence]</font></font>

149
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:05,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Perhaps tomorrow.</font></font>

150
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Perhaps next month.</font></font>

151
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty will strip you of your title</font></font>

152
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">whenever the mood strikes him.</font></font>

153
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How can a cripple who's lost his favor</font></font>

154
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ever inherit the throne?</font></font>

155
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:22,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is all Wu'an's fault.</font></font>

156
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

157
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty hasn't deposed you, after all.</font></font>

158
00:10:35,360 --> 00:10:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You still have a chance to fight back.</font></font>

159
00:10:42,910 --> 00:10:44,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Traitors have corrupted the realm.</font></font>

160
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's why Heaven sent this plague.</font></font>

161
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're the Crown Prince.</font></font>

162
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You must rid the court of corruption,</font></font>

163
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">save the people from suffering,</font></font>

164
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:55,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and achieve something truly great.</font></font>

165
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:00,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who are these traitors?</font></font>

166
00:11:00,870 --> 00:11:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't it obvious?</font></font>

167
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:03,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lady Li, of course,</font></font>

168
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:06,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and her daughter, Lady Wu'an. They've brought ruin to the realm.</font></font>

169
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to eliminate these traitors,</font></font>

170
00:11:10,870 --> 00:11:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you must get rid of Lu Zhuo first.</font></font>

171
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:45,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is a secret letter from Lord Han.</font></font>

172
00:11:50,860 --> 00:11:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Diman, King of Huta]</font></font>

173
00:11:55,670 --> 00:11:57,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The last time I allied with the Han family,</font></font>

174
00:11:58,000 --> 00:11:59,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I lost many of my men.</font></font>

175
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:01,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So this time,</font></font>

176
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why should I agree?</font></font>

177
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Majesty has suffered three defeats.</font></font>

178
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Each time, the Lu family</font></font>

179
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:11,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">kept your forces from Yunzhong and Yanmen.</font></font>

180
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:13,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're your greatest threat.</font></font>

181
00:12:14,030 --> 00:12:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If this plan succeeds, that threat will be gone.</font></font>

182
00:12:18,200 --> 00:12:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take a look, Your Majesty.</font></font>

183
00:12:20,720 --> 00:12:22,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once my master takes power,</font></font>

184
00:12:22,320 --> 00:12:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll let you use the land around Youbeiping Commandery,</font></font>

185
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with its lush pastures and thriving herds,</font></font>

186
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:29,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to graze your livestock for ten years!</font></font>

187
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:39,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good. Now that's a fine deal!</font></font>

188
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:41,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Dai Commandery, Yanmen, Yunzhong]</font></font>

189
00:12:41,260 --> 00:12:42,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Youzhou, Youbeiping, Shanggu]</font></font>

190
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Urgent military dispatch!</font></font>

191
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:45,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hengcheng Gate]
Urgent military dispatch!</font></font>

192
00:12:46,030 --> 00:12:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Make way! Urgent dispatch!</font></font>

193
00:12:48,870 --> 00:12:50,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Urgent dispatch!</font></font>

194
00:12:50,550 --> 00:12:52,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhao]</font></font>

195
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Huta have terrorized our northern border for decades.</font></font>

196
00:12:57,150 --> 00:12:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Countless people have suffered.</font></font>

197
00:12:58,750 --> 00:13:00,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've had enough!</font></font>

198
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo.</font></font>

199
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I command you to lead our armies</font></font>

200
00:13:04,790 --> 00:13:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">north to secure the border</font></font>

201
00:13:06,480 --> 00:13:07,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and crush the invaders.</font></font>

202
00:13:08,630 --> 00:13:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do not let me down.</font></font>

203
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I will do everything in my power</font></font>

204
00:13:16,150 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to secure the border and keep our people safe.</font></font>

205
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:26,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The situation is critical.</font></font>

206
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:28,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave the capital at once. No delays.</font></font>

207
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:30,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As you command, Your Majesty.</font></font>

208
00:13:31,500 --> 00:13:34,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhao]</font></font>

209
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo.</font></font>

210
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm entrusting the fate of our dynasty</font></font>

211
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">entirely to you.</font></font>

212
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If the situation becomes dire,</font></font>

213
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you have my authority</font></font>

214
00:13:51,510 --> 00:13:52,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to act as you see fit.</font></font>

215
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:55,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll give my life if I must</font></font>

216
00:13:56,030 --> 00:13:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to repay Your Majesty's trust.</font></font>

217
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:01,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shoucheng.</font></font>

218
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:04,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Watch out for those plotting against you.</font></font>

219
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:08,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Han Liao is eager to redeem himself</font></font>

220
00:14:08,670 --> 00:14:09,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and restore his family's honor.</font></font>

221
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:12,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's even willing to serve under you.</font></font>

222
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:14,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why turn him away?</font></font>

223
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who knows?</font></font>

224
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:19,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He might prove quite useful.</font></font>

225
00:14:19,550 --> 00:14:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Useful?</font></font>

226
00:14:23,270 --> 00:14:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Han Liao?</font></font>

227
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:27,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead and enjoy your little triumph.</font></font>

228
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The one who knows you best</font></font>

229
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will be your greatest enemy.</font></font>

230
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm off to the battlefield this time,</font></font>

231
00:14:33,630 --> 00:14:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I swear I'll earn glory beyond compare.</font></font>

232
00:14:35,670 --> 00:14:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll show the world</font></font>

233
00:14:37,120 --> 00:14:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo isn't the only hero in the Lu family!</font></font>

234
00:14:49,840 --> 00:14:51,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship, Lord Lu has been ordered to war.</font></font>

235
00:14:51,750 --> 00:14:52,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The situation is urgent.</font></font>

236
00:14:52,870 --> 00:14:54,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He sent me to apologize for his sudden departure.</font></font>

237
00:14:56,420 --> 00:14:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've seen this cold and barren world♪</font></font>

238
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:03,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And the long uncertain road ahead♪</font></font>

239
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:07,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Covered in mud, weathered by wind and frost♪</font></font>

240
00:15:07,940 --> 00:15:10,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Still I won't yield♪</font></font>

241
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:14,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've seen the falsehoods of this world♪</font></font>

242
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:18,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And learned to hide my edge♪</font></font>

243
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:23,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Step by step I plan, step by step I fight♪</font></font>

244
00:15:23,140 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪To trade it all for hope♪</font></font>

245
00:15:27,500 --> 00:15:34,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Why let the mire bind me? Why bow to fate?♪</font></font>

246
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:42,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll defy life's twists and smile through the gloom♪</font></font>

247
00:15:43,260 --> 00:15:50,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Grass grows beyond the cold path, proud against the moss♪</font></font>

248
00:15:51,300 --> 00:15:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Never yielding, never giving up till the skies clear♪</font></font>

249
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:21,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I rise above the clamor...♪</font></font>

250
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:22,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all right.</font></font>

251
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:23,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forget it.</font></font>

252
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on.</font></font>

253
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Singing as I go, carrying fragrance on my way♪</font></font>

254
00:16:30,020 --> 00:16:31,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Toward distant lands...♪</font></font>

255
00:16:31,270 --> 00:16:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao.</font></font>

256
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

257
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:35,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My brother will win.</font></font>

258
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:37,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's never lost a battle in his life.</font></font>

259
00:16:37,740 --> 00:16:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪My roots break through the earth...♪</font></font>

260
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

261
00:16:46,630 --> 00:16:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Rao.</font></font>

262
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'll come home safe.</font></font>

263
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

264
00:16:49,860 --> 00:16:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Why let the mire bind me why bow to fate...♪</font></font>

265
00:16:59,670 --> 00:17:00,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He didn't even say goodbye.</font></font>

266
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like I'm worried about him.</font></font>

267
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wonder how far the army has gotten.</font></font>

268
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have they won yet?</font></font>

269
00:17:11,720 --> 00:17:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get back to work.</font></font>

270
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Like I'm worried about him.</font></font>

271
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The enemy is gathering east of Longcheng.</font></font>

272
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At dawn, three days from now,</font></font>

273
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:34,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll personally lead our armored cavalry</font></font>

274
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in an assault on their main forces.</font></font>

275
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Generals of the Left and Right.</font></font>

276
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:38,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, sir!</font></font>

277
00:17:39,400 --> 00:17:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Each of you will lead 10,000 cavalry archers</font></font>

278
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to support our flanks.</font></font>

279
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:43,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Zhongkai.</font></font>

280
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take 10,000 soldiers</font></font>

281
00:17:46,200 --> 00:17:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and set an ambush upstream along this river.</font></font>

282
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Cut off their escape route to the north.</font></font>

283
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, General!</font></font>

284
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Brother.</font></font>

285
00:17:57,070 --> 00:17:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about my assignment?</font></font>

286
00:17:58,400 --> 00:17:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Ya.</font></font>

287
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:00,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This is a military camp,</font></font>

288
00:18:01,310 --> 00:18:02,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not a place for you to do as you please.</font></font>

289
00:18:02,510 --> 00:18:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General!</font></font>

290
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Grandfather sent me here to gain experience.</font></font>

291
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:06,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you've given me an empty title!</font></font>

292
00:18:06,540 --> 00:18:08,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to fight! Give me troops to command!</font></font>

293
00:18:08,160 --> 00:18:08,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Ya.</font></font>

294
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your brother is looking out for you.</font></font>

295
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can't charge into battle recklessly.</font></font>

296
00:18:12,070 --> 00:18:13,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go back and cool off.</font></font>

297
00:18:13,070 --> 00:18:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you afraid I'll win glory</font></font>

298
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and steal your spotlight? Don't touch me!</font></font>

299
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:22,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Second Young Master. Second Young Master!</font></font>

300
00:18:25,020 --> 00:18:26,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's young. It's only natural he's hotheaded.</font></font>

301
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:28,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After a few battles,</font></font>

302
00:18:28,510 --> 00:18:30,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">once he's faced life and death,</font></font>

303
00:18:30,480 --> 00:18:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he'll learn to be more levelheaded.</font></font>

304
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Pay him no mind.</font></font>

305
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I need to talk to you.</font></font>

306
00:18:35,750 --> 00:18:36,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Perfect.</font></font>

307
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have something to tell you, too.</font></font>

308
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:41,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo is always on guard around me.</font></font>

309
00:18:43,200 --> 00:18:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have you to thank for this.</font></font>

310
00:18:45,070 --> 00:18:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's the least I could do.</font></font>

311
00:18:45,930 --> 00:18:47,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Second Young Master.
- Don't follow me!</font></font>

312
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Second Young Master.</font></font>

313
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get lost!</font></font>

314
00:18:52,160 --> 00:18:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You know what to do, right?</font></font>

315
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That arrogant, inexperienced fool</font></font>

316
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:57,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">can't stand being challenged.</font></font>

317
00:18:58,110 --> 00:19:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry. With just a few words,</font></font>

318
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll turn those brothers</font></font>

319
00:19:02,200 --> 00:19:03,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">against each other.</font></font>

320
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sometimes an outsider sees things clearly.</font></font>

321
00:19:15,720 --> 00:19:16,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go talk some sense into him.</font></font>

322
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:18,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Someone! Saddle my horse!</font></font>

323
00:19:29,480 --> 00:19:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to know if she truly loves you,</font></font>

324
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why not find a chance to test her?</font></font>

325
00:19:38,070 --> 00:19:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've seen all my flaws</font></font>

326
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:42,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with your own eyes.</font></font>

327
00:19:42,830 --> 00:19:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But for some reason,</font></font>

328
00:19:45,110 --> 00:19:47,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want you to remember me</font></font>

329
00:19:47,110 --> 00:19:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">as someone a little kinder,</font></font>

330
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:51,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">someone better than I was.</font></font>

331
00:19:55,750 --> 00:19:56,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhao Song.</font></font>

332
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:09,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

333
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General, the fog is rolling in.</font></font>

334
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:25,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sound the drums! Assemble the troops!</font></font>

335
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All troops, hear my orders!</font></font>

336
00:20:57,640 --> 00:20:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A thick fog has fallen tonight.</font></font>

337
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's the perfect cover for a surprise attack.</font></font>

338
00:21:01,400 --> 00:21:03,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Keep silent and secure your armor.</font></font>

339
00:21:03,510 --> 00:21:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wrap the horses' hooves to muffle their steps.</font></font>

340
00:21:05,790 --> 00:21:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Follow me into the enemy's royal camp!</font></font>

341
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll take the King of Huta's head!</font></font>

342
00:21:09,880 --> 00:21:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kill ten enemy soldiers,</font></font>

343
00:21:11,550 --> 00:21:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you'll earn a promotion and two bolts of silk!</font></font>

344
00:21:15,070 --> 00:21:16,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kill a hundred,</font></font>

345
00:21:16,750 --> 00:21:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and you'll rise three ranks</font></font>

346
00:21:18,680 --> 00:21:19,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and receive a hundred gold pieces!</font></font>

347
00:21:19,750 --> 00:21:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Attack! - Attack!</font></font>

348
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:33,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Advance!</font></font>

349
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So that's your game, Lu Zhuo.</font></font>

350
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You deliberately spread false intelligence</font></font>

351
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to raid the Huta royal camp tonight.</font></font>

352
00:21:59,110 --> 00:22:00,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General, what do we do?</font></font>

353
00:22:02,750 --> 00:22:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bring me my horse! Now!</font></font>

354
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:04,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes! Right away!</font></font>

355
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go! Hurry!</font></font>

356
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The King of Huta fled northwest!</font></font>

357
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Qi Zhongkai.</font></font>

358
00:22:46,750 --> 00:22:48,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't forget our agreement.</font></font>

359
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:50,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I never agreed to betray my country.</font></font>

360
00:22:50,750 --> 00:22:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Huta army must be wiped out!</font></font>

361
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:55,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't forgotten my promise to you.</font></font>

362
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:02,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He wants both glory and the woman.</font></font>

363
00:23:02,750 --> 00:23:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His greed knows no bounds.</font></font>

364
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stick to the plan.</font></font>

365
00:23:05,440 --> 00:23:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, sir.</font></font>

366
00:23:20,070 --> 00:23:21,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Attack!</font></font>

367
00:24:17,400 --> 00:24:18,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General!</font></font>

368
00:24:21,960 --> 00:24:22,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General!</font></font>

369
00:24:22,750 --> 00:24:23,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Deputy General Lu Ya</font></font>

370
00:24:23,590 --> 00:24:24,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">was hunting down the remaining enemy troops</font></font>

371
00:24:24,590 --> 00:24:26,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when he ran into Wuzhu, the King of Huta's eldest son.</font></font>

372
00:24:26,550 --> 00:24:27,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He was lured into Iron Scorpion Ridge.</font></font>

373
00:24:27,790 --> 00:24:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's surrounded, and his fate is unknown!</font></font>

374
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who gave him permission to act on his own?</font></font>

375
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:34,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Xiao.</font></font>

376
00:24:34,830 --> 00:24:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take the prisoners back to camp.</font></font>

377
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go rescue him at Iron Scorpion Ridge.</font></font>

378
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:37,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes, sir!</font></font>

379
00:24:37,880 --> 00:24:38,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Move! - Move!</font></font>

380
00:24:39,550 --> 00:24:40,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Move out!</font></font>

381
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo, I...</font></font>

382
00:25:12,000 --> 00:25:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take everyone</font></font>

383
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and retreat along the mountain path to the right.</font></font>

384
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:16,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not leaving! I'll stay and cover you!</font></font>

385
00:25:16,830 --> 00:25:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Ya! Lu Ya, listen to me.</font></font>

386
00:25:19,110 --> 00:25:19,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you don't leave,</font></font>

387
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">neither of us will make it out alive.</font></font>

388
00:25:21,200 --> 00:25:21,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't!</font></font>

389
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go! Hurry!</font></font>

390
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get them all home safely!</font></font>

391
00:25:27,200 --> 00:25:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go!</font></font>

392
00:25:28,270 --> 00:25:28,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry!</font></font>

393
00:25:28,790 --> 00:25:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo!</font></font>

394
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You want to kill me, Lu Zhuo, don't you?</font></font>

395
00:25:44,960 --> 00:25:45,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then come and get me!</font></font>

396
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Wuzhu, Eldest Prince of Huta]
Kill Lu Zhuo!</font></font>

397
00:25:46,980 --> 00:25:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Avenge my father!</font></font>

398
00:25:49,310 --> 00:25:50,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Kill Lu Zhuo!</font></font>

399
00:26:09,830 --> 00:26:10,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Qi.</font></font>

400
00:26:11,110 --> 00:26:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I need to get back to the capital with the news.</font></font>

401
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tie him up.</font></font>

402
00:26:20,030 --> 00:26:20,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">General Qi!</font></font>

403
00:26:28,220 --> 00:26:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship, we've won a great victory.</font></font>

404
00:26:30,300 --> 00:26:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Our army is returning in triumph!</font></font>

405
00:27:24,540 --> 00:27:29,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Duke's Residence]</font></font>

406
00:27:41,030 --> 00:27:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Grandfather.</font></font>

407
00:27:43,200 --> 00:27:44,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My brother didn't let you down.</font></font>

408
00:27:45,830 --> 00:27:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He won a great victory.</font></font>

409
00:27:48,640 --> 00:27:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But he went back to save me,</font></font>

410
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:52,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and got trapped behind enemy lines.</font></font>

411
00:27:52,750 --> 00:27:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He had no choice but to lead them toward Death Valley.</font></font>

412
00:27:55,590 --> 00:27:56,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's all my fault.</font></font>

413
00:27:56,920 --> 00:27:59,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I should be the one who died, Grandfather!</font></font>

414
00:28:04,270 --> 00:28:05,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhuo!</font></font>

415
00:28:06,800 --> 00:28:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhuo!</font></font>

416
00:28:09,460 --> 00:28:10,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's dead.</font></font>

417
00:28:10,130 --> 00:28:11,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Oh, Zhuo!</font></font>

418
00:28:12,440 --> 00:28:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhuo, didn't you promise your mother</font></font>

419
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:17,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd come home victorious?</font></font>

420
00:28:20,350 --> 00:28:21,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lord Lu...</font></font>

421
00:28:21,270 --> 00:28:24,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please take Mother with you...</font></font>

422
00:28:28,790 --> 00:28:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao.</font></font>

423
00:28:30,240 --> 00:28:30,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry.</font></font>

424
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I couldn't bring him home safely.</font></font>

425
00:28:37,030 --> 00:28:37,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where are you going?</font></font>

426
00:28:38,270 --> 00:28:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know you can't accept this,</font></font>

427
00:28:39,200 --> 00:28:40,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">but you have to.</font></font>

428
00:28:40,240 --> 00:28:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo is dead.</font></font>

429
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:42,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We have to arrange his funeral.</font></font>

430
00:28:42,880 --> 00:28:43,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're his wife.</font></font>

431
00:28:44,350 --> 00:28:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No matter how much it hurts,</font></font>

432
00:28:45,510 --> 00:28:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you have to pull yourself together</font></font>

433
00:28:48,070 --> 00:28:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and give him the funeral he deserves.</font></font>

434
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:56,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wei Rao!</font></font>

435
00:29:09,140 --> 00:29:11,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhuyu Estate]</font></font>

436
00:29:12,920 --> 00:29:14,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Nothing can bring back the dead.</font></font>

437
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:15,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship, I'm so sorry for your loss.</font></font>

438
00:29:15,790 --> 00:29:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's better to cry than bottle it all up.</font></font>

439
00:29:17,790 --> 00:29:18,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Xiao.</font></font>

440
00:29:18,510 --> 00:29:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship.</font></font>

441
00:29:19,480 --> 00:29:21,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Gather everyone we can mobilize. Now.</font></font>

442
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:23,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How many can we assemble before sunset?</font></font>

443
00:29:23,680 --> 00:29:24,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How many do you need, Your Ladyship?</font></font>

444
00:29:25,070 --> 00:29:26,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhuyu Estate has 800 strongmen</font></font>

445
00:29:26,350 --> 00:29:27,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and 3,000 trained soldiers.</font></font>

446
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:28,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If that's not enough,</font></font>

447
00:29:28,440 --> 00:29:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">over the past two years,</font></font>

448
00:29:29,070 --> 00:29:30,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">30,000 drought victims have fled to the capital.</font></font>

449
00:29:31,070 --> 00:29:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">With outbreaks and earthquakes growing more frequent,</font></font>

450
00:29:32,640 --> 00:29:34,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">refugees from the twelve eastern commanderies have fled west.</font></font>

451
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:36,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are now 80,000 refugees around the capital.</font></font>

452
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Among them,</font></font>

453
00:29:37,550 --> 00:29:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at least 30,000 are able-bodied young adults.</font></font>

454
00:29:39,270 --> 00:29:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can we mobilize them?</font></font>

455
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The people believe you're a divine being.</font></font>

456
00:29:43,030 --> 00:29:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Only a divine being could survive the plague</font></font>

457
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:45,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and save so many lives.</font></font>

458
00:29:45,750 --> 00:29:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even the Emperor couldn't rally these people.</font></font>

459
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:49,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But if you call on them, they'll come.</font></font>

460
00:29:49,640 --> 00:29:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How many troops guard the capital and palace?</font></font>

461
00:29:51,830 --> 00:29:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those loyal to the Crown Prince and Zheng family</font></font>

462
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">number around 20,000 to 30,000.</font></font>

463
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:01,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sick and starving refugees...</font></font>

464
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:04,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could they stand against elite cavalry?</font></font>

465
00:30:06,750 --> 00:30:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Prepare 200 carrier pigeons. Write...</font></font>

466
00:30:13,880 --> 00:30:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship.</font></font>

467
00:30:16,070 --> 00:30:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship!</font></font>

468
00:30:39,350 --> 00:30:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship, His Majesty has issued a decree.</font></font>

469
00:30:41,400 --> 00:30:42,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's allowing the general's coffin into the palace,</font></font>

470
00:30:42,750 --> 00:30:44,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">where the High Shaman will perform the funeral rites.</font></font>

471
00:30:44,510 --> 00:30:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Court will be suspended for five days of mourning.</font></font>

472
00:30:46,200 --> 00:30:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All officials must wear mourning clothes for three days.</font></font>

473
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'll be posthumously honored as the Loyal and Valiant.</font></font>

474
00:30:49,590 --> 00:30:51,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And buried with the honors of a prince.</font></font>

475
00:30:53,110 --> 00:30:54,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Understood.</font></font>

476
00:30:54,980 --> 00:30:57,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've seen the falsehoods of this world♪</font></font>

477
00:30:58,420 --> 00:31:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And learned to hide my edge...♪</font></font>

478
00:31:05,200 --> 00:31:06,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once someone's dead, it's all over.</font></font>

479
00:31:08,400 --> 00:31:10,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">All that's left is an empty shell.</font></font>

480
00:31:11,830 --> 00:31:14,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What good does wearing mourning clothes and crying do?</font></font>

481
00:31:17,310 --> 00:31:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave me.</font></font>

482
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get out!</font></font>

483
00:31:26,340 --> 00:31:33,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Grass grows beyond the cold path, proud against the moss♪</font></font>

484
00:31:34,380 --> 00:31:40,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Never yielding, never giving up till the skies clear...♪</font></font>

485
00:32:01,030 --> 00:32:01,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship.</font></font>

486
00:32:02,680 --> 00:32:04,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You haven't eaten a thing all day.</font></font>

487
00:32:04,270 --> 00:32:06,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please, have a little soup.</font></font>

488
00:32:09,640 --> 00:32:11,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He gave me this.</font></font>

489
00:32:12,680 --> 00:32:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He picked it out just for me.</font></font>

490
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Ladyship...</font></font>

491
00:32:17,260 --> 00:32:20,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I stand upon the frozen wilds...♪</font></font>

492
00:32:21,830 --> 00:32:23,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">As long as Lu Zhuo was alive,</font></font>

493
00:32:25,030 --> 00:32:27,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">they were terrified of him.</font></font>

494
00:32:28,300 --> 00:32:31,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Anywhere I can go...♪</font></font>

495
00:32:33,590 --> 00:32:35,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But now he's dead.</font></font>

496
00:32:39,200 --> 00:32:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's dead.</font></font>

497
00:32:40,480 --> 00:32:47,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I'll defy life's twists and smile through the gloom...♪</font></font>

498
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't let them get away with this.</font></font>

499
00:32:52,310 --> 00:32:53,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those who hurt Lu Zhuo...</font></font>

500
00:32:54,270 --> 00:32:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I won't let them celebrate!</font></font>

501
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:56,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Never!</font></font>

502
00:32:56,660 --> 00:33:02,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Never yielding, never giving up till the skies clear♪</font></font>

503
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Aman.</font></font>

504
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:08,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help me get dressed.</font></font>

505
00:33:15,440 --> 00:33:17,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lu Zhuo is dead?</font></font>

506
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's really gone?</font></font>

507
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:22,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good.</font></font>

508
00:33:24,000 --> 00:33:25,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Very good!</font></font>

509
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:28,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Word has come from the palace.</font></font>

510
00:33:28,590 --> 00:33:31,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His Majesty was so distraught that he coughed up blood and passed out.</font></font>

511
00:33:31,960 --> 00:33:33,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The palace is in chaos.</font></font>

512
00:33:33,920 --> 00:33:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

513
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:37,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We must act tonight. There's no time to lose.</font></font>

514
00:33:37,440 --> 00:33:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take the palace gates.</font></font>

515
00:33:38,880 --> 00:33:40,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness, lead your men into the inner palace.</font></font>

516
00:33:40,590 --> 00:33:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Grand Commandant Zheng will secure the city gates.</font></font>

517
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:44,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By the time everyone wakes at dawn,</font></font>

518
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:47,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it'll all be over.</font></font>

519
00:33:54,400 --> 00:33:56,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness, shall we march on the palace now?</font></font>

520
00:33:56,830 --> 00:33:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

521
00:34:00,750 --> 00:34:02,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll personally lead my guards</font></font>

522
00:34:03,680 --> 00:34:06,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to kill the traitors at His Majesty's side first.</font></font>

523
00:34:08,440 --> 00:34:11,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll accompany Your Highness to Zhuyu Estate.</font></font>

524
00:34:11,320 --> 00:34:13,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Zhuyu Estate]
Use Wei Rao's head as our war offering.</font></font>

525
00:34:13,230 --> 00:34:14,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That'll send morale soaring.</font></font>

526
00:34:39,630 --> 00:34:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness, we've searched all of Zhuyu Estate.</font></font>

527
00:34:41,320 --> 00:34:42,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's not a soul here.</font></font>

528
00:34:42,230 --> 00:34:43,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lady Wu'an is nowhere to be found, either.</font></font>

529
00:34:44,110 --> 00:34:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Someone must have leaked our plans.</font></font>

530
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:47,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's how Wei Rao escaped in time.</font></font>

531
00:34:48,550 --> 00:34:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Those people...</font></font>

532
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They've already hidden in the mountains.</font></font>

533
00:34:51,480 --> 00:34:52,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

534
00:34:55,550 --> 00:34:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Something's wrong.</font></font>

535
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Quick!</font></font>

536
00:34:57,110 --> 00:34:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get to the palace! Now!</font></font>

537
00:35:06,780 --> 00:35:09,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hengcheng Gate]</font></font>

538
00:35:22,940 --> 00:35:25,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Hengcheng Gate]</font></font>

539
00:35:25,380 --> 00:35:31,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Prince Jing's Residence]</font></font>

540
00:35:34,510 --> 00:35:35,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

541
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've been ordered to escort you.</font></font>

542
00:35:37,920 --> 00:35:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Ordered?</font></font>

543
00:35:39,630 --> 00:35:40,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">By whom?</font></font>

544
00:35:41,070 --> 00:35:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you part of this rebellion, too?</font></font>

545
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:43,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

546
00:35:43,960 --> 00:35:44,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please come with us.</font></font>

547
00:35:55,670 --> 00:35:56,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go with you.</font></font>

548
00:35:57,150 --> 00:35:58,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Leave the women out of this.</font></font>

549
00:35:58,710 --> 00:35:59,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Orders are orders.</font></font>

550
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forgive my disrespect.</font></font>

551
00:36:01,510 --> 00:36:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take everyone</font></font>

552
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">into custody!</font></font>

553
00:36:06,880 --> 00:36:07,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">This way, Your Highness.</font></font>

554
00:36:22,590 --> 00:36:23,850
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's going to be unrest in the city.</font></font>

555
00:36:23,850 --> 00:36:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What should I do?</font></font>

556
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hidden rocks lie beneath the deep currents.</font></font>

557
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:30,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And danger lurks beyond the path to safety.</font></font>

558
00:36:31,570 --> 00:36:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The omen says a trapped dragon faces disaster.</font></font>

559
00:36:34,550 --> 00:36:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The Crown Prince has marched into the palace.</font></font>

560
00:36:36,920 --> 00:36:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If he takes the throne,</font></font>

561
00:36:38,440 --> 00:36:40,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'll lose everything we've worked for!</font></font>

562
00:36:41,110 --> 00:36:42,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Fate is what we make of it.</font></font>

563
00:36:43,440 --> 00:36:45,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe I shouldn't trust your readings.</font></font>

564
00:36:47,550 --> 00:36:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A dragon waits beneath the waters,</font></font>

565
00:36:49,510 --> 00:36:50,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ready to rise when the time is right.</font></font>

566
00:36:51,110 --> 00:36:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness,</font></font>

567
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:53,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">please be patient.</font></font>

568
00:36:58,960 --> 00:37:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're right, my dear.</font></font>

569
00:37:01,590 --> 00:37:03,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Gather our men first.</font></font>

570
00:37:04,190 --> 00:37:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll back whoever wins.</font></font>

571
00:37:29,340 --> 00:37:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Xuanshi Palace]</font></font>

572
00:37:36,190 --> 00:37:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard my father was unwell.</font></font>

573
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've come to check on him, even at this late hour.</font></font>

574
00:37:40,110 --> 00:37:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go inside and inform him.</font></font>

575
00:37:41,590 --> 00:37:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If Father condemns that wicked consort</font></font>

576
00:37:42,920 --> 00:37:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and her two children to death,</font></font>

577
00:37:44,880 --> 00:37:46,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not a single soldier I've brought</font></font>

578
00:37:46,090 --> 00:37:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will dare enter and disturb him.</font></font>

579
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:52,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your Highness.</font></font>

580
00:37:53,030 --> 00:37:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The victors take the throne. The losers pay the price.</font></font>

581
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:57,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's no turning back now.</font></font>

582
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:58,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've come this far.</font></font>

583
00:37:58,960 --> 00:38:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why not storm the palace?</font></font>

584
00:38:02,030 --> 00:38:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're just a woman.</font></font>

585
00:38:04,030 --> 00:38:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you know about affairs of state?</font></font>

586
00:38:05,280 --> 00:38:06,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm the rightful heir to the throne,</font></font>

587
00:38:06,670 --> 00:38:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not some treasonous rebel!</font></font>

588
00:38:08,000 --> 00:38:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My father is old and sick.</font></font>

589
00:38:09,400 --> 00:38:11,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He can't live forever, can he?</font></font>

590
00:38:11,550 --> 00:38:13,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Once I have an abdication decree bearing the imperial seal,</font></font>

591
00:38:13,550 --> 00:38:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll be the rightful new emperor.</font></font>

592
00:38:15,630 --> 00:38:17,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The court officials and the common people,</font></font>

593
00:38:17,070 --> 00:38:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the princes throughout the realm</font></font>

594
00:38:18,400 --> 00:38:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">will all willingly bow to me.</font></font>

595
00:38:21,880 --> 00:38:23,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Forgive my ignorance.</font></font>

596
00:38:25,710 --> 00:38:27,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A wise man knows when to yield.</font></font>

597
00:38:27,840 --> 00:38:30,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Father will make the right choice.</font></font>

598
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You raise an army in rebellion</font></font>

599
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and still expect the people to embrace you?</font></font>

600
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How laughably foolish.</font></font>

601
00:38:37,400 --> 00:38:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If it were me...</font></font>

602
00:39:08,020 --> 00:39:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The candlelight suddenly chills the window♪</font></font>

603
00:39:14,620 --> 00:39:20,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whose shadow stirs the ripples in another's heart?♪</font></font>

604
00:39:21,980 --> 00:39:28,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That sigh is soft yet thunders like a drum♪</font></font>

605
00:39:29,260 --> 00:39:35,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪And leaves the world around us strangely still♪</font></font>

606
00:39:36,780 --> 00:39:42,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've grown used to walking through the cold♪</font></font>

607
00:39:43,780 --> 00:39:49,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I've seen the broken shadows beneath all the splendor♪</font></font>

608
00:39:51,060 --> 00:39:57,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪But like the wind you stir the calm within my eyes♪</font></font>

609
00:39:58,340 --> 00:40:05,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Until this game of testing has no winner or loser♪</font></font>

610
00:40:05,500 --> 00:40:12,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We're so close I forget how to breathe♪</font></font>

611
00:40:13,620 --> 00:40:20,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your gaze is like fire flickering yet searing my secrets♪</font></font>

612
00:40:20,940 --> 00:40:25,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The sharpness I've hidden inside my weakness♪</font></font>

613
00:40:26,420 --> 00:40:34,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Scatters into disarray the moment you lean close♪</font></font>

614
00:40:34,540 --> 00:40:42,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪We're so close I hear my heartbeat break free♪</font></font>

615
00:40:42,740 --> 00:40:49,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Who lost their plan and who lost their breath in this moment?♪</font></font>

616
00:40:50,020 --> 00:40:55,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Even if you'll still be far beyond my reach♪</font></font>

617
00:40:55,580 --> 00:41:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪At least right now there's only an inch between us♪</font></font>
